<title>FRANCE: Iran seeks 100,000 T optional barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran seeks 100,000 T optional barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran plans to tender on January 27 to import 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The barley is for shipment in April, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
